  // the task leaves IN_CALL) — persists the workbench call timer.
  assignedAt DateTime?
  callbackAt DateTime?
  // C4: no-answer retry backoff — written by the call-center
  // automation layer after a NO_ANSWER outcome; the claim paths skip
  // the task while this is in the future (see src/callcenter/store.ts).
